OL,3,GNEWSACreative grants to help showcase
OL,4,Adockyard history
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists and community groups are being
OL,7,Fencouraged to apply for "creative and
OL,8,Fcultural projects" to celebrate 200
OL,9,Fyears of a famous dockyard.
OL,11,FThe projects will be part of a
OL,12,Fsix-month celebration of the city's
OL,13,Fpeople and history called "Gloucester
OL,14,FUnlocked," organised by Together
OL,15,FGloucester.
OL,17,FThe programme is open to local artists
OL,18,Fand community groups, who can apply for
OL,19,Fgrants of up to #5,000.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
