OL,5,
OL,6,FManager of Gloucester's Business
OL,7,FImprovement District (BID) Emily Gibbon
OL,8,Fsaid that the grants will also provide
OL,9,Fan "opportunity to learn more" about
OL,10,Fcreative industries.
